        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira mirongwibiri n’indwi Yerobowamu umwami w’Abisirayeli ari ku ngoma, Uziya mwene Amaziya umwami w’i Buyuda ni ho yima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.26.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 26:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.26.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagiye ku ngoma amaze imyaka cumi n’itandatu, ayimarakw imyaka mirongwitanu n’ibiri i Yerusalemu; nyina yitwa Yekoliya w’i Yerusalemu nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari vyiza, nk’ivyo se Amaziya yakoze vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.14.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 14:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugabo ibitabo vyo ku mpinga z’imisozi ntivyakūrwaho; abantu bari bagitangira ibimazi mur’ ivyo bitabo, bakahosereza imibavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
