          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira mirongwitatu n’umunani Uziya umwami w’i Buyuda ari ku ngoma, ni ho Zekariya mwene Yerobowamu yima i Samariya mu Bisirayeli; amara amezi atandatu ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 14:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi, nk’uko ba sekuruza bākora, ntiyava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakwegeyemw’ Abisirayeli ngo bacumure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Shalumu mwene Yabeshi aramugarariza, amugurukirakw imbere y’abantu, aramwica, asubira ku ngoma yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Zekariya vyanditswe mu gitabo c’ivyo ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.10.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 10:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyabaye nk’ukw ijambo Uhoraho yari yarabariye Yehu ryāvuze, rit’ Abana bawe bazokomeza ku ngoma mu Bisirayeli gushitsa ku mwuzukururuza wawe. Nuko birashika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
