        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira mirongwitatu n’icenda Uziya umwami w’ Abayuda ari ku ngoma, ni ho Menahemu mwene Gadi yima mu Bisirayeli; amara imyaka cumi i Samariya ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi, ntiyigeze ava mu vyaha vya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, ivyo yakwegeyemw’ Abisirayeli ngo bacumure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.5.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 5:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Puli umwami w’i Ashuri atera igihugu; maze Menahemu amuhongera italanto z’ifeza igihumbi, kugira ngo buzure, amuhagarikire, ahangame ku ngoma yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ayo mahera Menahemu yari yayatoje mu Bisirayeli, mu bantu b’abatunzi, umuntu wese yari yamutoje shekeli mirongwitanu, ngw ayahe umwami w’i Ashuri. Nuk’ uwo mwami w’i Ashuri arahindukira, ntiyaguma mur’ ico gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Non’ ibindi vyose vyadonzwe kuri Menahemu, n’ivyo yakoze vyose, mbega ntivyanditswe mu gitabo c’ivyo ku ngoma z’abami b’Abisirayeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Menahemu ahamvya ba sekuruza, maz’ umuhungu wiwe Pekahiya asubira ku ngoma yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
