          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira mirongwitanu Uziya umwami w’Abayuda ari ku ngoma, ni ho Pekahiya mwene Menahemu yima i Samariya mu Bisirayeli; amara imyaka ibiri ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
